abstract: >-
  Julia code, observational data, completed runs and plotting notebook that reproduce the results and figures of
  the paper "A Genetic Algorithm Approach to Reconstructing Scalar-Tensor Lagrangians". A genetic algorithm evolves
  symbolic expressions for the nonminimal coupling F(φ) and the scalar potential U(φ) of a scalar-tensor theory,
  and ranks them against DESI DR2 BAO, Pantheon+ supernovae calibrated with SH0ES Cepheids, compressed CMB distance
  priors and fσ8 redshift-space distortion data. The observational data are third-party; their sources and the
  papers to cite are listed in data/README.md.
